{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1560684-funny-initiation-rituals","id":1560684,"title":"Funny Initiation Rituals?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-06-17T13:04:23-07:00","id":1560684,"title":"Funny Initiation Rituals?","content":"<b>Virtual Adepts:</b><br /> <br /> Have you ever won a multiplayer championship game of Snake?<br /> <br /> Can you plug in all your USB connections the right way, on your first try?<br /> <br /> Can you fluently speak, read and write in the language of holy binary?<br /> <br /> Can you resolve a performance issue by simply talking to the machine, instead of messing with its code?<br /> <br /> Did your Avatar manifest itself in the form of a <i>'stats screen?' </i>with an AI voice over?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-18T08:48:25-07:00","id":1560710,"title":"","content":"Have you ever been in a 2 v 2 hacker battle where both people on a team had to use their keyboard at the same time (NCIS)?<br /> <br /> Have you been in a battle of incantations where spells are judged not just on effect but on rhythm and flow?<br /> <br /> Have you ever competed with other Masters to see who can get your apprentices to believe the most ridiculous training session? &quot;When you can balance a tack hammer on your head you can head off your foes with a balanced attack&quot; - The Sphynx.<br /> <br /> Have you ever competed to find the most ridiculous tech support issue that was fixed by turning it off and on again?<br /> <br /> Have you ever competed to find the most outlandish thing that was considered coincidental is some reality zone (Horizon Realms and Sanctums don't count)?<br /> <br /> Have you ever competed to to see who can create the biggest startup company with only $100 and a limited number of social media posts?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-22T00:01:11-07:00","id":1560848,"title":"","content":"Sons of ether:<br /> Have you ever took the approximative translation of a fragment of an alchemical tablet from egypt, a few observations on the evolution on dancing patterns in Spanish pubs and a random &quot;what if the world is&quot; rant from a drunk guy on the internet, and combined those three into a consistent, effective and most importantly, classy model of SCIENCE?<br /> <br /> Syndicate<br /> Have you ever competed to see how much you can gain in money and favours while dropped alone in a random small town, with only a glass of pepsi to trade?<br /> <br /> Cult of Exctasy<br /> Have you ever tried to find the most original way to take litterally &quot;go fuck yourself&quot;?<br /> <br /> NWO<br /> Have you ever succeeded in maintaining three different alliegeances in the office, while double thinking 4 different mutually exclusive reasons for your actions?<br /> <br /> Progenitors<br /> Have you ever created/modified a lifeform to accomplish a complex outdoor task...WITHOUT LETTING THE DAMN THING ESCAPE INTO THE OUTSIDE WORLD???<br /> <br /> Taftani<br /> Have you ever tricked a Djinn into breaking his own rules with a loophole?<br /> <br /> Order of Hermes<br /> Have you ever finished the codex Hermeticus, with at least 5 different analysis texts and chosed a side in the centuries long conflict between the two group interpreting chapter 17, paragraph 11?<br /> <br /> Celestial chorus<br /> Have you ever organised a succesful collective prayer with 10 members of mutually exclusive and hostile faiths?<br /> <br /> Virtual adept<br /> Have you ever hacked a devided by coding in morse by tipping on it?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-22T08:35:29-07:00","id":1560859,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1560684-funny-initiation-rituals?p=1560848#post1560848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Syndicate<br /> Have you ever competed to see how much you can gain in money and favours while dropped alone in a random small town, with only a glass of pepsi to trade?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, yes, the 'trade quest chain' approach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-22T09:14:26-07:00","id":1560864,"title":"","content":"Virtual Adepts: <br /> <br /> Did you criticize the plot of S.O.M.A by claiming that their brain scanning technology was 'primitive' or 'amateur work?'<br /> <br /> Is your idea of mass ascension anything even remotely similar to the series 'Pantheon?'<br /> <br /> Can you keep this tamagachi alive for a whole year?<br /> <br /> Does your familiar resemble your favorite digimon?<br /> <br /> Do you consider Megaman's Battle Network to be a viable form of societal infrastructure?<br /> <br /> Do you believe that reincarnation isekai might be a valid religion?<br /> <br /> <br /> ---------------------------<br /> <br /> Order of Hermes:<br /> <br /> Do you preface all your spells by boisterously shouting &quot;I CAST-&quot; followed by the spell's name and / or function?<br /> <br /> Are you a fan of beard styling competitions?<br /> <br /> Do believe that the extreme, shocking levels of danger and negligence the Hogwarts faculty display towards their students will ultimately produce better wizards?<br /> <br /> Tell me which is better; the wand, or the staff? And please explain your reasoning.<br /> <br /> Do you have a long distance friendship with a being from the Umbra?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name"